      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i need help writing an email to my boss. im the head of dev for this new fintech app and the project scope is just getting way too big. things are being added every single day and we aren't gonna hit the october launch date at this rate. i need to ask for either more people on the team or a delay. can u help me make it sound professional but firm?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Subject: Request for Additional Resources or Project Timeline Adjustment\n\nDear [Boss's Name],\n\nI hope this email finds you well. I wanted to bring to your attention a matter that requires our immediate attention. As the head of development for our new fintech app, I've been closely monitoring the project's progress and scope. While the enthusiasm and dedication of our team have been commendable, I must express my concern about the rapidly expanding project scope.\n\nEvery day, new features and functionalities are being added, and it seems that we are constantly playing catch-up. This relentless pace is causing us to struggle to meet our original launch date in October. I believe that to ensure the success of our app, we need to either expand our team or consider a slight delay in our launch.\n\nI understand that this may not be the news we hoped for, but I assure you that this request is made with the project's best interests in mind. By either bringing in additional resources or adjusting our timeline, we can ensure that the final product meets our high standards and truly delivers value to our users.\n\nI would greatly appreciate your thoughts on this matter and am open to discussing potential solutions. Thank you for your understanding and support.\n\nBest regards,\n[Your Name]",
